msgid ""
"Posted on the station electronic request board:\n"
"\n"
"Request services of vessel in the area to scan asteroids in search of "
"asteroid with particular characteristics. Substantial reward. No formal "
"contract available. For further details, contact Jenny McGuire"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_36_scurvy_scavenger.lua:5089
#: scripts/scenario_36_scurvy_scavenger.lua:6221
#: scripts/scenario_36_scurvy_scavenger.lua:6695
msgctxt "Jenny-comms"
msgid "Contact Jenny McGuire"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_36_scurvy_scavenger.lua:5095
#, lua-format
msgctxt "Jenny-comms"
msgid ""
"Hi %s, I'm so glad you contacted me. I've been researching many of the "
"nearby asteroids. There is one in particular that I am interested in. "
"Unfortunately, I lost access to sensors with enough detail to scan from a "
"distance and my research ship was shot out from under me by pirates. I was "
"lucky to escape with my life. I would like to locate my special asteroid, "
"but I did not record location details, only sensor details. The asteroid I "
"am interested in has traces of osmium and iridium, both of which are fairly "
"rare, but together, they are exceptionally rare. If you run across an "
"asteroid like that, could you let me know? If I were able to continue my "
"research, I would be very appreciative. I know several technicians that "
"would be more than willing to provide your ship with a valuable upgrade."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_36_scurvy_scavenger.lua:5103
msgctxt "Jenny-comms"
msgid "We will look, but can't promise anything"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_36_scurvy_scavenger.lua:5109
msgctxt "Jenny-comms"
msgid ""
"Thanks. I understand about priorities. Please contact me if you find anything"
msgstr ""

